Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:53:50 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: List all validation errors on top of the event form

Model::allErrors returns every validation error (attribute => message). Event::LABELS and Event::label keep the pt-BR field labels in one place, used by the form labels and by the new _errors partial, which lists "Label: message" escaped above the form while the per-field feedback stays.
